# Demo Video Evidence — NRG Eternal Seal Step 4

**Status**: PENDING_RECORDING

## Requirements

- [ ] ≤3 minutes
- [ ] Screencap on sovereign staging
- [ ] Flow: login → 1 query per tier → audit chain verify → scorecard dashboard
- [ ] Subtitles present (burned in or SRT)
- [ ] SHA-256 computed after recording

## Recording Command (on sovereign cluster)

```bash
# Terminal 1: port-forward
kubectl port-forward svc/api 8000:8000 &

# Terminal 2: record with ffmpeg
ffmpeg -f x11grab -framerate 30 -video_size 1920x1080 \
  -i :0.0 -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast \
  pitch/NRG_DEMO.mp4
```

## Post-Recording

```bash
# Compute SHA-256
sha256sum pitch/NRG_DEMO.mp4 > docs/handover/evidence/04_demo.sha256

# Verify
cat docs/handover/evidence/04_demo.sha256
# Expected format: <hash>  pitch/NRG_DEMO.mp4
```

